[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3705706852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114488#issuecomment-3705706852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114488","id":3705706852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c4Jlk","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T16:16:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T16:16:30Z","body":"> Use `StringName` keys in the dictionaries for a small performance boost.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html#pull-request-requirements","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3705706852/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3705934078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114488#issuecomment-3705934078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114488","id":3705934078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c5BD-","user":{"login":"BenLubar","id":4257305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4257305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar","html_url":"https://github.com/BenLubar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T18:01:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T18:04:01Z","body":"Without the SNAME macro:\r\n<img width=\"1670\" height=\"1590\" alt=\"string_sticker\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af193094-b4d6-42a9-9293-22eee5755353\" />\r\n\r\nWith the SNAME macro:\r\n<img width=\"1670\" height=\"2234\" alt=\"stringname_sticker\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1aa12b7a-9594-475f-8d81-da1b3cc1ee67\" />\r\n\r\nSo there is a non-trivial amount of time being spent on allocating many copies of each string.\r\n\r\nI think it *should* be okay to replace the keys of a dictionary from String to StringName because the engine already converts between them automatically. So the only code this would have the potential to break would be code that explicitly checks the dictionary key types.\r\n\r\nIt might be better for me to just rewrite my gdextension a